Kite

Kite reimplements, in Crow, the behaviour of KLineChart (klinecharts),
Copyright the KLineChart authors, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (https://github.com/klinecharts/KLineChart): its candles,
indicators, axes, crosshair, tooltips, overlays and styles, held to the
numbers and pixels it draws. No KLineChart source is included; its
formulas and layout rules were read from version 10.0.0-beta1 and written
anew.
